rce association and title/author artwork visually reviewed; not only HTTP200"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:1609","key":{"work_id":976100001,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":976100001,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":976300001,"text":"De geschiedenis van koning Arthur wordt hier verteld vanuit de vrouwen die zijn wereld mede vormgeven. Hun overtuigingen en onderlinge verhoudingen bepalen hoe zij de gebeurtenissen rond Arthur en zijn ridders ervaren. Naast die wereld bestaat Avalon, een eiland dat niet voor iedereen toegankelijk is. De roman brengt persoonlijke verbondenheid en strijd om invloed samen met de verschillende religieuze tradities die in deze versie van de legende met elkaar botsen.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/464231/nevelen-van-avalon.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T11:04:00Z","review_batch":"nl005-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/464231/nevelen-van-avalon.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Source content actually read; original Dutch synopsis, identity reviewed separately","sha256":"c0dc0719666b7cd1873d1c9012aebbf2746da023f54556339e8ec4287b2828dd"}]}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789025368067","key":{"id":976200106},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":976100002,"title":"Verliefde vrouwen","isbn_13":"9789025368067","isbn_10":null,"language":"nld","publisher":"Singel Uitgeverijen","open_library_edition_id":null,"id":976200106}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789025368067","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789025368067"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789025368067","work_id":976100002,"bound_author_id":976300002,"bound_title":"Verliefde vrouwen","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789025368067","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https://meta