piers hebben ieder hun redenen om belangstelling voor het document te tonen. De vampier Matthew Clairmont helpt haar de geheimen ervan te onderzoeken. Hun toenemende verbondenheid maakt de zoektocht ingewikkelder, omdat hun wereld strikte grenzen stelt aan zulke relaties.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/76761/allerzielen.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T11:04:00Z","review_batch":"nl005-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/76761/allerzielen.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Source content actually read; original Dutch synopsis, identity reviewed separately","sha256":"8104bc3d0ad7a2940b5d2fc0c820ca3d8c5523f7faf36baf54806225ffbf0aeb"}]}},{"relation":"editions","ref":"edition:9789463107983","key":{"id":976200108},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":976100004,"title":"Iron Widow","isbn_13":"9789463107983","isbn_10":null,"language":"nld","publisher":"Pelckmans uitgevers","open_library_edition_id":null,"id":976200108}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789463107983","key":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789463107983"},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":"@edition:9789463107983","work_id":976100004,"bound_author_id":976300004,"bound_title":"Iron Widow","bound_language":"nld","bound_isbn13":"9789463107983","format":"paperback","cover_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000629352_Iron_Widow_0_0.jpg","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1946734/iron-widow.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T11:04:00Z","review_batch":"nl005-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1946734/iron-widow.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","sha256":"c3672d099f0b3e4561925c4cae52f77a501cbea8f35147614f1dba32d3c691e8","fact":"Exact title/author/ISBN, physical format and language source reviewed; independent contradictions recorded"},{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/ie_fcache/0000629352_Iron_Widow_0_0.jpg","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T10:56:29.538Z","sha256":"3835839b5894d5151c2a02e0ccee013a6e630761e045ca06210d95bcb6855929","bytes":115663,"fact":"Same-edition source association and title/author artwork visually reviewed; not only HTTP200"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:2710","key":{"work_id":976100004,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":976100004,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":976300004,"text":"In Huaxia besturen jongens en meisjes samen grote gevechtsmachines, maar de meisjes betalen vaak met hun leven voor die samenwerking. Zetian meldt zich aan met een persoonlijk doel: wraak op de piloot die haar zus heeft gedood. Nadat zij haar eerste gevecht op onverwachte wijze overleeft, richt haar woede zich op het systeem achter de offers. Ze wil voorkomen dat andere meisjes hetzelfde lot ondergaan, terwijl de oorlog ondertussen doorgaat.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1946734/iron-widow.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T11:04:00Z","review_batch":"nl005-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1946734/iron-widow.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Source content actually read; original Dutch synopsis, identity reviewed separately","sha256":"c3672d099f0b3e4561925c4cae52f77a501cbea8f35147614f1dba32d3c691e8"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","ref":"metadata:9789021056890","key":{"edition_id":976200005},"before":null,"after":{"edition_id":976200005,"work_id":976100005,"bound_author_id":976300005,"bound_title":"Alchemised","bound_language":"dut","bound_isbn13":"9789021056890","format":"hardcover","cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/15162548-L.jpg?default=false","card_cover_url":null,"evidence_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1959061/alchemised.html","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T11:04:00Z","review_batch":"nl005-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1959061/alchemised.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","sha256":"aefcfed37b4a73ae6e07290fa18c82c40404fc947a1886bb933eb535d37cf2f4","fact":"Exact title/author/ISBN, physical format and language source reviewed; independent contradictions recorded"},{"url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/15162548-L.jpg?default=false","checkedAt":"2026-11-01T11:01:25.838Z","sha256":"1f6ab6120cb9cadbefb10e8dc8527d6c520217a47756ffd95d488b823c281b68","bytes":48364,"fact":"Same-edition source association and title/author artwork visually reviewed; not only HTTP200"}]}},{"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","ref":"description:3301","key":{"work_id":976100005,"language":"nl"},"before":null,"after":{"work_id":976100005,"language":"nl","bound_author_id":976300005,"text":"Helena Marino is na de nederlaag van het verzet krijgsgevangene in Paladia. Haar vroegere werk als alchemist biedt weinig bescherming tegen de nieuwe machthebbers en hun necromantie. Bovendien ontbreken er maanden in haar geheugen. Haar ondervragers vermoeden dat juist die verdwenen herinneringen belangrijke informatie bevatten. Helena moet onderzoeken wat zij nog van zichzelf kan vertrouwen, terwijl anderen proberen te bepalen welke rol zij in de afgelopen oorlog heeft gespeeld.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Bureau ISBN; oorspronkelijke gecontroleerde samenvatting","source_url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1959061/alchemised.html","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","review_status":"approved","reviewed_at":"2026-11-01T11:04:00Z","review_batch":"nl005-01-20261101","evidence":[{"url":"https://metadata.isbn.nl/1959061/alchemised.html","checkedAt":"2026-11-01","fact":"Source content actually read; original Dutch synopsis, identity reviewed separately","sha256":"aefcfed37b4a73ae6e07290fa18c82c40404fc947a1886bb933eb535d37cf2f4"}]}},{